w40k-ach-khorne-attunement-veteran-t = oath to Khorne
w40k-ach-khorne-attunement-veteran-d = Embrace the straight path of wrath and slaughter by dedicating yourself to Khorne at the start of a round eight times.
w40k-ach-khorne-attunement-veteran-k = Select Khorne 8 times across your career.
w40k-ach-khorne-attunement-veteran-r = Unlocks reward: mark of Khorne

w40k-ach-nurgle-attunement-veteran-t = favor of Nurgle
w40k-ach-nurgle-attunement-veteran-d = Accept endurance, decay, and the promise of inevitability by dedicating yourself to Nurgle at the start of a round eight times.
w40k-ach-nurgle-attunement-veteran-k = Select Nurgle 8 times across your career.
w40k-ach-nurgle-attunement-veteran-r = Unlocks reward: mark of Nurgle

w40k-ach-slaanesh-attunement-veteran-t = touch of Slaanesh
w40k-ach-slaanesh-attunement-veteran-d = Walk the path of excess and razor-sharp sensation by dedicating yourself to Slaanesh at the start of a round eight times.
w40k-ach-slaanesh-attunement-veteran-k = Select Slaanesh 8 times across your career.
w40k-ach-slaanesh-attunement-veteran-r = Unlocks reward: mark of Slaanesh

w40k-ach-tzeentch-attunement-veteran-t = design of Tzeentch
w40k-ach-tzeentch-attunement-veteran-d = Trust in hidden designs and shifting fortunes by dedicating yourself to Tzeentch at the start of a round eight times.
w40k-ach-tzeentch-attunement-veteran-k = Select Tzeentch 8 times across your career.
w40k-ach-tzeentch-attunement-veteran-r = Unlocks reward: mark of Tzeentch

# Combat
w40k-ach-fireline-initiation-t = Fireline Initiation
w40k-ach-fireline-initiation-d = Earn your place in the line where bolter fire and lasfire never stop, and eliminate 12 enemies in a single round without dying.
w40k-ach-fireline-initiation-k = Kill 12 enemies in one round without dying.

w40k-ach-first-contact-t = First Contact
w40k-ach-first-contact-d = When the front finally closes to killing distance, show no hesitation and score 8 enemy kills in a single round.
w40k-ach-first-contact-k = Kill 8 enemies in one round.

w40k-ach-blood-rush-t = Blood Rush
w40k-ach-blood-rush-d = Hit the enemy line so hard it never has time to recover, and eliminate 15 enemies in a single round.
w40k-ach-blood-rush-k = Kill 15 enemies in one round.

w40k-ach-iron-survivor-t = Iron Survivor
w40k-ach-iron-survivor-d = Stand through the worst the battlefield can offer, and eliminate 10 enemies in a single round without dying.
w40k-ach-iron-survivor-k = Kill 10 enemies in one round without dying.

w40k-ach-blade-dancer-t = Blade Dancer
w40k-ach-blade-dancer-d = Victory is not always won by the last blow, so shape the fight and earn 8 combat assists in a single round.
w40k-ach-blade-dancer-k = Earn 8 assists in one round.

w40k-ach-huntmaster-t = Huntmaster
w40k-ach-huntmaster-d = Learn to spot the next kill through smoke, dust, and muzzle flash by eliminating 150 enemies across your career.
w40k-ach-huntmaster-k = Kill 150 enemies total.

w40k-ach-execution-streak-t = Execution Streak
w40k-ach-execution-streak-d = Leave behind broken lines and emptied strongpoints by eliminating 300 enemies across your career.
w40k-ach-execution-streak-k = Kill 300 enemies total.

# Support
w40k-ach-no-one-left-t = No One Left Behind
w40k-ach-no-one-left-d = On a battlefield this brutal, a few seconds can save a life; stabilize 8 fallen comrades in a single round.
w40k-ach-no-one-left-k = Stabilize 8 allies in one round.

w40k-ach-battle-medic-round-t = Battle Medic
w40k-ach-battle-medic-round-d = There is no calm behind the line, only work under fire; revive 4 fallen comrades in a single round.
w40k-ach-battle-medic-round-k = Revive 4 allies in one round.

w40k-ach-golden-hands-t = Golden Hands
w40k-ach-golden-hands-d = Bring allies back from the edge often enough that your hands become part of the war effort itself, and revive 40 allies across your career.
w40k-ach-golden-hands-k = Revive 40 allies total.

w40k-ach-stabilizer-line-t = Stabilizer Line
w40k-ach-stabilizer-line-d = Keep the casualty chain from becoming a collapse, and stabilize 12 fallen comrades in a single round.
w40k-ach-stabilizer-line-k = Stabilize 12 allies in one round.

w40k-ach-field-hospital-t = Field Hospital
w40k-ach-field-hospital-d = Patch flesh, metal, and shattered nerves until it feels like you have rebuilt a regiment, and accumulate 120 units of healing progress across your career.
w40k-ach-field-hospital-k = Accumulate 120 heal buckets total.

w40k-ach-no-time-to-die-t = No Time to Die
w40k-ach-no-time-to-die-d = As long as you remain standing, others still have a chance; revive 6 fallen comrades in a single round without dying yourself.
w40k-ach-no-time-to-die-k = Revive 6 allies in one round without dying.

# Logistics
w40k-ach-convoy-master-t = Convoy Master
w40k-ach-convoy-master-d = Wars are won by supply as surely as by gunfire, so complete 2 cargo missions in a single round.
w40k-ach-convoy-master-k = Complete 2 cargo missions in one round.

w40k-ach-freight-runner-t = Freight Runner
w40k-ach-freight-runner-d = When the front demands shells, fuel, and spare parts, hesitation kills; complete 1 cargo mission in a single round.
w40k-ach-freight-runner-k = Complete 1 cargo mission in one round.

w40k-ach-quartermaster-general-t = Quartermaster General
w40k-ach-quartermaster-general-d = Build a reputation measured in manifests and delivered orders by completing 20 cargo missions across your career.
w40k-ach-quartermaster-general-k = Complete 20 cargo missions total.

w40k-ach-high-value-cargo-t = High-Value Cargo
w40k-ach-high-value-cargo-d = Move enough strategic supply through the war machine that the whole campaign feels it, and accumulate 120 cargo mission value across your career.
w40k-ach-high-value-cargo-k = Accumulate 120 cargo mission value total.

w40k-ach-supply-line-chief-t = Supply Line Chief
w40k-ach-supply-line-chief-d = A single well-run supply push can hold a sector together; accumulate 14 cargo mission value in a single round.
w40k-ach-supply-line-chief-k = Accumulate 14 cargo mission value in one round.

w40k-ach-heavy-hauler-t = Heavy Hauler
w40k-ach-heavy-hauler-d = Let columns of materiel follow in your wake and accumulate 350 cargo mission value across your career.
w40k-ach-heavy-hauler-k = Accumulate 350 cargo mission value total.

# Objective
w40k-ach-triad-stand-t = Triad Stand
w40k-ach-triad-stand-d = Lock the whole front in place by holding three strategic points for ten continuous minutes in one round.
w40k-ach-triad-stand-k = Hold 3 strategic points for 10 minutes in one round.

w40k-ach-field-engineer-t = Field Engineer
w40k-ach-field-engineer-d = Win the race for the map itself by constructing three strategic points in a single round.
w40k-ach-field-engineer-k = Build 3 strategic points in one round.

w40k-ach-escalation-order-t = Escalation Order
w40k-ach-escalation-order-d = Keep the war machine climbing by upgrading four strategic point tiers in a single round.
w40k-ach-escalation-order-k = Upgrade 4 strategic point tiers in one round.

w40k-ach-master-builder-t = Master Builder
w40k-ach-master-builder-d = Lay down enough fortified positions that whole campaigns start on your foundations, and build 30 strategic points across your career.
w40k-ach-master-builder-k = Build 30 strategic points total.

w40k-ach-bastion-smith-t = Bastion Smith
w40k-ach-bastion-smith-d = Turn raw structures into proper strongholds by upgrading 60 strategic point tiers across your career.
w40k-ach-bastion-smith-k = Upgrade 60 strategic point tiers total.

w40k-ach-strongpoint-saboteur-t = Strongpoint Saboteur
w40k-ach-strongpoint-saboteur-d = Crack open enemy footholds before they snowball by destroying two hostile strategic points in a single round.
w40k-ach-strongpoint-saboteur-k = Destroy 2 enemy strategic points in one round.

# Participation
w40k-ach-veteran-of-wars-t = Veteran of Wars
w40k-ach-veteran-of-wars-d = Campaigns are carried by those who keep returning to the line, so complete 40 rounds as a faction member.
w40k-ach-veteran-of-wars-k = Finish 40 faction rounds.

w40k-ach-never-miss-briefing-t = Never Miss a Briefing
w40k-ach-never-miss-briefing-d = Be the kind of soldier who shows up when the order is given and stays until the work is done by actively participating in 15 rounds.
w40k-ach-never-miss-briefing-k = Be active in 15 rounds.

w40k-ach-victory-parade-t = Victory Parade
w40k-ach-victory-parade-d = Not every career ends in cheers and banners, so earn that rare sight by winning 20 rounds across your career.
w40k-ach-victory-parade-k = Win 20 rounds total.

w40k-ach-steadfast-tour-t = Steadfast Tour
w40k-ach-steadfast-tour-d = Long service hardens a fighter as surely as battle itself, so complete 100 rounds as a faction member.
w40k-ach-steadfast-tour-k = Finish 100 faction rounds.

w40k-ach-present-at-war-t = Present at War
w40k-ach-present-at-war-d = A veteran's name is built from constancy more than a single glorious day, so actively participate in 120 rounds.
w40k-ach-present-at-war-k = Be active in 120 rounds.

w40k-ach-campaign-planner-t = Campaign Planner
w40k-ach-campaign-planner-d = Think beyond the next firefight and help carry a wider campaign by participating in 20 completed missions.
w40k-ach-campaign-planner-k = Complete 20 missions.

# Hidden
w40k-ach-whispers-in-void-t = Whispers in the Void
w40k-ach-whispers-in-void-d = Sometimes the machine spirit answers only to a name that belongs in neither doctrine nor briefing.
w40k-ach-whispers-in-void-k = Type the command "kaiser" in the console.

wh40k-meta-progress-secret-kaiser-unlocked = A whisper answers from the void. Achievement unlocked.
wh40k-meta-progress-secret-kaiser-already = The void already remembers that name.
wh40k-meta-progress-secret-kaiser-error = Failed to unlock the secret achievement: {$error}

# Special
w40k-ach-all-complete-t = Completionist
w40k-ach-all-complete-d = Leave behind a record of victories, losses, survival, and service by obtaining every other achievement.
w40k-ach-all-complete-k = Complete all achievements.
